ah. — 1Sa 1:24.","refs":[["1Sam",1,24,1,24]]},{"text":"Of David. — Ps 132:2-5.","refs":[["Ps",132,2,132,5]]},{"text":"Of mariners who cast out Jonah. — Jon 1:16.","refs":[["Jonah",1,16,1,16]]},{"text":"Of Jonah. — Jon 2:9.","refs":[["Jonah",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"Of Lemuel’s mother. — Pr 31:1,2.","refs":[["Prov",31,1,31,1],["Prov",31,2,31,2]]},{"text":"Of Paul. — Ac 18:18.","refs":[["Acts",18,18,18,18]]},{"text":"Of certain Jews with Paul. — Ac 21:23,24,26.","refs":[["Acts",21,23,21,23],["Acts",21,24,21,24],["Acts",21,26,21,26]]},{"text":"All things dedicated by, to be brought to the tabernacle — De 12:6,11,17,18,26.","refs":[["Deut",12,6,12,6],["Deut",12,11,12,11],["Deut",12,17,12,17],["Deut",12,18,12,18],["Deut",12,26,12,26]]},{"text":"Of things corrupt or blemished an insult to God — Le 22:23; Mal 1:14.","refs":[["Lev",22,23,22,23],["Mal",1,14,1,14]]},{"text":"The hire of a prostitute or price of a dog could not be the subject of — De 23:18.","refs":[["Deut",23,18,23,18]]}],"refCount":48}
